  "title": "Empowering the Next Generation Through Job Readiness at Airtech",
  "summary": "Our colleagues at Airtech Vacuum in Rutherford, New Jersey hosted a Job Readiness Workshop for 25 high school students from Great Oaks Legacy Charter School and Covenant House this month, in partnership with Jersey Cares. The workshop was designed to help young adults and teens preparing to enter the workforce, connect with industry professionals, strengthen their resumes, […]",
